          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="label_4">
            <property name="font">
             <font>
              <bold>true</bold>
             </font>
            </property>
            <property name="text">
             <string>About phasic and tonic REM sleep</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="label_9">
            <property name="text">
             <string>&lt;b&gt;Tonic REM&lt;/b&gt; corresponds to a more stable REM activity, with minimal eye movements and a lower physiological variability. &lt;b&gt;Phasic REM&lt;/b&gt; is characterized by bursts of rapid eye movements, transient muscle activity, and an increased neural and autonomic activation. This separation enables a more detailed investigation of the REM sleep dynamics and of the related biomarkers.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The REM sleep epochs are divided into mini-epochs of the chosen length. A mini-epoch is phasic when it holds at least a third of the duration of a detected REM, tonic otherwise.</string>
            </property>
            <property name="textFormat">
             <enum>Qt::TextFormat::RichText</enum>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
            <property name="variant" stdset="0">
             <string notr="true">help</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
